  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets. Slice onion into wedges. <br>• Place broccoli and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat. <br>• Roast until tender, 15-20 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6858a0055baaf2916c052df6/step-c81eb300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. <br>• Cook fusilli in boiling water over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins. <br>• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6858a0055baaf2916c052df6/step-a5a0f410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When veggies are done, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium heat.<br>• Cook garlic seasoning and the plain flour until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in cooking cream, the stock powder, milk, Dijon mustard and reserved pasta water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins.<br>• Add cooked pasta, roast veggies and baby spinach, stirring to combine.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6858a0055baaf2916c052df6/step-7c633820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat grill to high. <br>• Transfer pasta to a baking dish. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese. Grill until golden, 5-10 mins. <br>• Divide pasta bake between bowls. Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6858a0055baaf2916c052df6/step-81e2b830.jpeg"
    }
  ]
